timestamp=2026-11-09T09:12:37.601Z level=INFO run=e6571189 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# The salary_amount in the CSV does NOT match (hours*rate + bonus). But the task says:\n# \"calculate the total monthly salary for each employee for every month. The total salary is the sum of:\n# (total hours worked in the month × hourly rate) + any bonuses earned for completed tasks in that month.\"\n# So we should compute it ourselves based on the formula given in the task, not use salary_amount from the file.\n# Also bonuses depend on performed_tasks (completed tasks). That matches.\n# So we must ignore salary_amount and bonus columns from the dataset? And compute ourselves.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
